ring people together through humor. Memes are a major part of internet culture, and many people enjoy sharing them with friends. The character’s expressions and appearance make it easy for creators to come up with new jokes that continue to entertain audiences.\n\nIn conclusion, Mama Coco is the best meme because she is recognizable, adaptable, and consistently funny. While many internet memes disappear after a short time, Mama Coco continues to inspire creative and hilarious content that keeps people laughing.", "hashtags": ["#funny", "#fyp", "#mamacoco", "#viral", "#funnyvideo"], "music": {"title": "original sound", "author": "Luis Lopez", "play_url": "https://v16-webapp-prime.us.tiktok.com/video/tos/useast5/tos-useast5-v-27dcd7-tx/oIIMIAjAQH7AQaXApPeJCev8INCmFHQfeQOp7S/?a=1988&bti=ODszNWYuMDE6&&bt=125&ft=GcAInInz7ThyFfZGXq8Zmo&mime_type=audio_mpeg&rc=M3E0a3I5cjtxPDMzZzU8NEBpM3E0a3I5cjtxPDMzZzU8NEBlMW81MmRzZ3NhLS1kMS9zYSNlMW81MmRzZ3NhLS1kMS9zcw%3D%3D&expire=1788215386&l=20260831162924E7D60DE948B451112CB1&ply_type=3&policy=3&signature=e921f954d0a210ebfec1efc4bb29040a&tk=0&btag=e00078000"}, "media_url": "", "text": "", "text_source": "none", "provider": "apify", "region": "GLOBAL", "region_source": "", "captured_at": "2026-08-31T16:29:40+00:00", "cluster": "", "trend_slug": "coco"}, {"video_id": "6864255359092083973", "url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@.strxwberry_cow/video/6864255359092083973", "author": "@.strxwberry_cow", "views": 578.0, "likes": 90.0, "comments": 7.0, "reposts": 1.0, "description": "Coco is our new mascot!🥰 got her in an egg today! #fyp #foryou #cute #newmascot #mascot #kangaroo #live #join #viral #roblox #adoptme #pets #joinlive", "hashtags": ["#fyp", "#foryou", "#cute", "#newmascot", "#mascot", "#kangaroo", "#live", "#join", "#viral", "#roblox", "#adoptme", "#pets", "#joinlive"], "music": {"title": "one day", "author": "Slowed sounds🥰", "play_url": "https://v19.tiktokcdn-us.com/928d7e19421270a39db762571d30e9c2/6a8f5bce/video/tos/useast5/tos-useas